---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const description =
  "Joshua Young is from Cincinnati and lives in San Francisco. He studied at Duke and has been to more than fifty countries.";
---

<Base title="About" description={description}>
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm from Cincinnati. I live in San Francisco.
    </p>
    <p>
      I studied computer science and classical languages at Duke, and I was a teaching assistant
      for computer architecture and operating systems. I was a software engineer at Clear Street
      in New York, then at Clearview AI.
    </p>
    <p>
      I have been to more than fifty countries, including a full year outside the United States. I
      ran the Boston Marathon in 2:39:56, the Flying Pig in 2:47:48, and the Athens Marathon in
      3:21:52. I hiked Everest Base Camp &amp; Three Passes and climbed Chimborazo,
      Cotopaxi, Fuji, and Olympus, and saw a game at the 2022 World Cup in Qatar.
    </p>
    <p>
      I have been to Antarctica, the Galápagos, and the Amazon. I went to weddings in Jaipur and
      Vadodara, celebrated Holi in Vrindavan and Songkran in Chiang Mai, and walked Troy, Mycenae,
      Delphi, Olympia, and Pompeii. I also dug at Tel Hazor.
    </p>
    <p>
      More of what I've built is on the <a href="/work">work page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
